  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "Touring cluster: two round dials around a centre map, after BMW's classic Live Cockpit. The dials use the reference's thin chrome rims, black faces, numbers inside the rims and thin needles; the left is revs (0-8) with the gear, AUTO and a fuel bar, the right is speed on the car's speed scale; the middle window is the Waze map (or a light stand-in map when it is off), with navigation, now playing and the Ankara weather in its top strip. Full screen: clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Theme decorations and the DEMO tag come from the engine; no oil, coolant, torque or power readouts. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
